    "detailed_description": "About this game<br />\r\n<br />\r\nRun your dungeon as 4 different classes<br />\r\n<br />\r\n   - Slash and smash incoming adventurers as a warrior.<br />\r\n   - Make use of the souls of the dead as a necromancer.<br />\r\n   - Harvest nature and the elements as an elementalist.<br />\r\n   - Make smart and tactical decisions as a tactician.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nRecruit different types of monster and creatures to fight for you<br />\r\n<br />\r\n   - Support units will help you keep your dungeon running, providing you with income and mana. Goblins mostly fill this role.<br />\r\n   - Orcs, demons, slimes and more will fight for you, defending your dungeon from curious adventurers who venture too close.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nEncounter different events<br />\r\n<br />\r\n   - Things are never dull when you are running a dungeon. Different people will pass by and events might happen. It could be the local village paying tribute to you out of fear, or a butch of fearless adventurers knocking on your door.",
